WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.443
Retention controls how long enquiries and applications are kept.

00:00:05.493 --> 00:00:09.345
CV expiry is separate, so files can expire sooner.

00:00:09.395 --> 00:00:13.480
Both accept one to three hundred and sixty-five days.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.523
Storage meters show media and CV usage,

00:00:16.573 --> 00:00:20.892
and the clean-up section reports the latest nightly run.
